WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.214
Learning is durable change in capability.

00:00:02.214 --> 00:00:05.738
A learner can explain more clearly, make a better decision,

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:08.910
perform a step more accurately, recognize a cue earlier,

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.729
or apply an idea in a new situation.

00:00:11.729 --> 00:00:14.901
Neuroplasticity helps explain why durable learning requires active engagement.

00:00:14.901 --> 00:00:19.482
The nervous system changes more reliably when learners use the skill, retrieve information,

00:00:19.482 --> 00:00:22.302
correct errors, and repeat the process over time.

00:00:22.302 --> 00:00:24.768
Memory formation is practical, not just academic.

00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:27.940
People need to encode information, revisit it, retrieve it,

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:30.054
and connect it to existing knowledge.

00:00:30.054 --> 00:00:35.693
Practice and retrieval matter because they force the learner to bring information back and use it.

00:00:35.693 --> 00:00:37.103
Rereading may feel fluent,

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:42.036
but recall and application provide stronger evidence that the learning is available when needed.

00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:47.322
Repetition with variation helps skill formation because real work rarely looks exactly like the lesson.

00:00:47.322 --> 00:00:49.084
Exact repetition can build familiarity,

00:00:49.084 --> 00:00:52.608
but variation teaches what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:52.608 --> 00:00:56.837
A learner who practices several versions of a task is more likely

00:00:56.837 --> 00:00:58.952
to recognize the underlying pattern later.

00:00:58.952 --> 00:01:02.828
Feedback and correction make those repetitions useful rather than simply familiar.

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:07.057
Automaticity can develop when parts of a skill are practiced enough that

00:01:07.057 --> 00:01:08.819
they require less conscious effort.

00:01:08.819 --> 00:01:11.991
That can free attention for judgment, monitoring, and adaptation.

00:01:11.991 --> 00:01:13.753
But automaticity is not perfection.

00:01:13.753 --> 00:01:17.982
It needs safeguards, review, and continued feedback when the stakes are high.

00:01:17.982 --> 00:01:21.858
Neuroplasticity supports skill development, but it does not replace deliberate practice,

00:01:21.858 --> 00:01:23.620
good design, or responsible review.
